4.9 How to Refuse
How to Refuse an Alcohol Sale Recap
• Always practice World Class Customer Service, even when refusing an alcohol
sale. Be polite and courteous, and do notjudge or be accusatory towards the
customer.
• Calmly explain to the customer that you cannot sell alcohol to them, but do
not get into specifics of why you are refusing the sale,
